# -------------------------
# Keep essential project files tracked
# -------------------------
# Do not ignore:
# - Source code (.py, .js, .jsx, .css)
# - package.json and package-lock.json
# - requirements.txt
# - README.md
# - START_PROJECT.bat
# - .env.example
# - Model files required by the detectors